WEBVTT

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.480
I'm building a case in every moment

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.840
Every interaction holds the potential for disaster

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.100
I paint the room with intuition

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.640
But my chaos was born from an old affliction

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.500
A tremendous burden...

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.540
And I never questioned who put it there.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:31.580
I walk into a room already reading the faces

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.160
Looking for the cracks in all the comfortable spaces

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.800
A change in conversation, I'm connecting the traces

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.380
Building up a case from imaginary statements

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:41.680
I can feel the tension, I can sense the hesitation

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.240
But I never stop to question my interpretation

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:46.860
Every little silence turns into an accusation

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.800
Every interaction feels like confrontation

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.380
I was raised on disappointment, learned to live in expectation

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.000
Made a fortress out of fear and called it preparation

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.600
Took a lifetime of rejection, gave it justification

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.260
Now I'm fighting with the ghosts of my imagination

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.560
And I swear that I can see it

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.820
Every motive, every reason

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.140
But the truth is I've been bleeding

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.440
From a wound that needed healing

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:06.960
If everybody leaves

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.240
And I'm the one who stays

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.540
If nobody sees the world

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:10.520
The way I paint the place...

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.020
IF I'M THE ONLY ONE THAT FITS!

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.600
THAT'S A LONELY FUCKING PLACE!

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:17.460
I built a world around the damage

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:19.940
Put a thousand ghosts in every face!

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:22.720
I KEEP SEARCHING FOR A REASON!

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.120
I KEEP BUILDING UP A CASE!

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:27.960
But the only one on trial

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:32.840
Is the man I couldn't face!

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.120
I built a man from a memory, filled in the gaps with a fantasy

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.400
Turned an absence into an identity, carried the weight of a legacy

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:39.860
Never existed the way I envisioned, I gave it a name and defended the fiction

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:42.600
Made every decision through damaged perception, mistaking obsession for intuition

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.220
I was a kid with a question, a lifetime of looking for answers

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.820
Reading the room for rejection, anticipating disaster

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.400
Every emotion a warning, every expression a factor

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:53.060
Writing a story before anybody could finish the chapter

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:54.320
And I got good at the guessing

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:55.480
Got addicted to knowing

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:56.960
Got so caught in perception

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:58.100
I forgot I was growing

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.580
See, the trouble with intuition

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:00.760
When it's poisoned by pain

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.180
Is you start to see conviction

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:03.500
Where there's nothing to explain

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.000
What if they weren't judging?

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:07.600
What if they weren't leaving?

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:10.320
What if every little silence

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:12.860
Didn't have a hidden meaning?

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:16.260
What if all this time...

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:19.500
I was the only one believing?

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:25.020
I DON'T NEED ANOTHER CASE!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.340
I DON'T NEED ANOTHER REASON!

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:27.660
I DON'T NEED TO TURN A FEELING

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:28.960
INTO EVIDENCE OF TREASON!

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.240
I can recognize the damage

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:31.560
Without giving it a name

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:32.860
I can carry all the lessons

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.160
Without carrying the shame

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:35.380
I can look into the mirror

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:36.720
See the child and the man

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:37.900
See the distance between them

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.220
And finally understand

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.700
I wasn't born with this burden

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:41.920
I was taught how to carry

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.440
Built a world out of uncertainty

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.860
And made the weight hereditary

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.540
But I can question my conclusions

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:47.820
I can let the silence stay

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.160
I don't have to make a prison

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.500
Out of every fucking day!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.520
IF I'M THE ONLY ONE THAT FITS!

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:54.980
THAT'S A LONELY FUCKING PLACE!

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.760
I spent a lifetime building walls

00:02:59.280 --> 00:02:59.820
Then wondered why nobody stayed!

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:03.140
I KEEP SEARCHING FOR A REASON!

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.440
I KEEP BUILDING UP A CASE!

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:08.460
But I don't have to live forever

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.620
In the world my fear creates!

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.160
I paint the room with intuition...

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.980
But the picture isn't always true.

